{"3125250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "STORROR Parkour Pro", "steam_appid": 3125250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras/ff8feb694777dcf773236f72f7e8abec.avif?t=1773854175\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras_big/ff8feb694777dcf773236f72f7e8abec.avif?t=1773854175 width=800 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras/f65e17b78ac011976f16d6b996a5a036.avif?t=1773854175\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras_big/f65e17b78ac011976f16d6b996a5a036.avif?t=1773854175 width=800 height=112 /></span><strong>The city is your playground. The risk is real. The path is yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour legends STORROR and game developer HITS collaborate for <strong>STORROR Parkour Pro</strong>… A physics-driven experience that will immerse you in an authentic urban environment. Master your movement, challenge your instincts, and traverse a city designed for limitless creative potential. This Early Access release is focused on a core, reliable experience that is both challenging and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras/62f9c1591225bbde17599ec2eaa518a8.avif?t=1773854175\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras_big/62f9c1591225bbde17599ec2eaa518a8.avif?t=1773854175 width=800 height=112 /></span><strong>JOIN THE MOVEMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cutting edge animation system, that combines motion-captured animations from the best parkour athletes in the world, with physics driven movement, to create the perfect balance of realistic and arcade gameplay, pushing the boundaries of parkour, animation and movement in games to a whole new level. No two moves are the same, and with hundreds of unique parkour animations, you can jump, climb, vault, flip, slide, swing, stride and so much more, with the most complete set of parkour mechanics in any game ever, right at your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're developing this game in tandem with our community, treating every player as a partner in design. Through Early Access, your feedback directly influences our roadmap, from refining core movement to deciding on the next great challenge. This shared journey ensures that every feature we build, every bug we fix, and every new city we design is a direct response to what players need to make this the ultimate parkour experience. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras/eb6d7a3013957843843e50cd4a897d65.avif?t=1773854175\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras_big/eb6d7a3013957843843e50cd4a897d65.avif?t=1773854175 width=800 height=112 /></span><strong>Endless Pursuit of FREEDOM OF MOVEMENT &amp; FLOW</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate set of moves means nothing without the ability to choose what you do and when you do it. An intuitive and engaging control system gives you total freedom over each and every move, in a way that's easy to learn but difficult to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras/518e9d9abe38dfef4d6ebfa06a194853.avif?t=1773854175\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras_big/518e9d9abe38dfef4d6ebfa06a194853.avif?t=1773854175 width=800 height=112 /></span><strong>Environment is your PLAYGROUND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the streets and rooftops in a re-imagining of London's Isle of Dogs. Climb moving cranes, ride on top of trains, and escape from helicopters. The world is filled with challenges and opportunities for you to express your creativity and discover London from a whole new perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras/60313f67a7f3cd318de5f4519f71480b.avif?t=1773854175\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras_big/60313f67a7f3cd318de5f4519f71480b.avif?t=1773854175 width=800 height=112 /></span><strong>Play as a PARKOUR ATHLETE on a never-ending journey of confronting RISK and growing in CONFIDENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every challenge is an opportunity to confront <strong>risk</strong> and test your judgment. In this <strong>ever-expanding journey</strong>, you can hone your skills on pre-set <strong>Line Challenges</strong>, or push your limits against the clock in <strong>Speed Challenges</strong>. Take on the high-stakes <strong>first Storror Mission</strong> to truly test your courage and develop you parkour mastery. No matter the task—whether you’re racing, showing off your moves in a skill challenge, or hunting down hidden <strong>collectibles</strong>—successfully navigating these risks will build your confidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras/3fca580ea499dbf2fa77e5af41fdf2a9.avif?t=1773854175\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras_big/3fca580ea499dbf2fa77e5af41fdf2a9.avif?t=1773854175 width=800 height=112 /></span><strong>Your SHARED ADVENTURE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to confront a mission or challenge on your own or with your friends in a game of <strong>Chase and Escape</strong>, every event is designed to be a shared adventure. This is just the beginning; as your journey of growth continues, you will be able to unite with a dedicated team to face new challenges together.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras/ff8feb694777dcf773236f72f7e8abec.avif?t=1773854175\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras_big/ff8feb694777dcf773236f72f7e8abec.avif?t=1773854175 width=800 height=112 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras/f65e17b78ac011976f16d6b996a5a036.avif?t=1773854175\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras_big/f65e17b78ac011976f16d6b996a5a036.avif?t=1773854175 width=800 height=112 /></span><strong>The city is your playground. The risk is real. The path is yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parkour legends STORROR and game developer HITS collaborate for <strong>STORROR Parkour Pro</strong>… A physics-driven experience that will immerse you in an authentic urban environment. Master your movement, challenge your instincts, and traverse a city designed for limitless creative potential. This Early Access release is focused on a core, reliable experience that is both challenging and rewarding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125250/extras/62f9c1591225bbde17599ec2eaa518a8.avif?t=1773854175\"